	quest.35A9B130B7506074.title: "Act III"
	quest.35BBAE826D1C4F1B.quest_subtitle: "The Apotheosis mod greatly changes enchantments by adding Eterna, Quanta, and Arcana. Eterna determines the enchantment level of your enchanting table (it is possible to enchant items higher than level 30). Quanta determines the level of enchantments you will obtain on your items; the higher your Quanta, the higher the enchantment level is likely to be. Finally, Arcana is used to obtain rare enchantments. A high arcana level makes enchantments like looting easier to obtain."
	quest.35EBFB05782907E0.quest_subtitle: "{atm9.quest.productiveBees.subt.cocoaPodsJungle}"
	quest.35EBFB05782907E0.title: "{atm9.quest.productiveBees.sugarbagBee}"
